            <div xml:id="m-852acabd-1084-49e4-b0a8-8ed0128bd66c">
              <lg xml:id="m-f6082c78-1a35-469b-9479-a7f97ccf53d6">
                <l xml:id="m-03900c61-87fb-48d2-bf9b-be34060c2a41" facs="#m-361ac8bf-a5a4-4519-b5e5-11241ecd98e9" label="text-like">The Circumcision of Our Lord.</l><l xml:id="m-07fd2cda-b436-4e2c-b3ba-0eac84c2c260" facs="#m-87f9645a-b9a9-4afa-b66e-4ba2b76f4a50" label="ambiguous">440</l><l xml:id="m-ec8357d4-b801-43e7-80a4-0eced4ccbc24" facs="#m-fc3d8ae4-5f76-496b-99ea-5d558da7d9ce" label="ambiguous">DECEMBER 31.</l><l xml:id="m-16978cc6-d736-48d9-acf7-b6d6c54ad74a" facs="#m-1c0fd0f0-6069-4fb4-8bd7-00d73093bc57" label="text-like">S. Silvester Pope and Confessor. Double.</l><l xml:id="m-b5404c6b-6e43-4efd-a598-6d181199f68c" facs="#m-87ca33db-d66d-4852-8273-a8abaf77f2e0" label="text-like">AT FIRST VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-d9fcfa3b-79ca-4932-a78f-df82cdd5d8e4" facs="#m-871ef64c-65db-4bcb-882e-1030a8305a5f" label="text-like">Antiphons and Psalms of the Nativity. p. 411. — From the Chapter, all is</l><l xml:id="m-28eb3bec-fc0f-462f-946f-b6f929ab0a13" facs="#m-2fe73425-198e-4062-b38c-e13276f3a4be" label="text-like">taken from the Common of a Confessor and Bishop, p. 1173. — Commemora¬</l><l xml:id="m-a97f7133-01b8-4334-8e0a-8741ed9fa3c7" facs="#m-30a3e412-2244-4671-8192-ac2a5ae8b4b2" label="text-like">tion of the Nativity, p. 413.</l><l xml:id="m-567e7431-fc2d-420d-8e24-966b52735b4b" facs="#m-adad3b8e-932f-4783-9502-f0e66f8f1cbd" label="text-like">Mass. Si diligis me. p. 1122r.</l><l xml:id="m-ff79de4c-c0cd-4d16-b3df-e6294a7da205" facs="#m-ade217e2-f7f7-49cc-aacb-375a3f7d1511" label="ambiguous">Collect.</l><l xml:id="m-67f72900-2891-4668-a280-c5380ffa9dd6" facs="#m-7fff6e65-1643-4988-abb4-5ec239a0236e" label="lyrics-like">Regem tuum, Pastor aetérne, (cem, perpétua protectióne custódi:*</l><l xml:id="m-8d8c5735-0da6-4b6a-9fcd-93377dbd8bfd" facs="#m-69afe6f6-c292-4931-8c75-f2de8e08d675" label="lyrics-like">( placátus inténde: t et per bea-quem totlus Ecclésiae praestitisti</l><l xml:id="m-06c7d323-0a44-4cb6-bc53-cb60083b38ff" facs="#m-b6e9cecd-19f9-48af-a2a1-724f805ea7cd" label="lyrics-like">tum Silvéstrum Summum Pontifi-Iesse pastórem. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-a696e28e-2b26-4834-acd8-7a1f02ff24d3" facs="#m-66148814-e320-497f-8b44-154a6aa35476" label="text-like">Commemoration is then made of the Nativity, p. 408.</l><l xml:id="m-0164bd05-0e9f-4421-b8e5-8ab19ef290e0" facs="#m-205ec80d-ed8b-4590-8848-24542cebbf54" label="text-like">THE CIRCUMCISION OF OUR LORD</l><l xml:id="m-9b67346d-f702-4e00-979c-106ddd058112" facs="#m-58fe0c83-014a-4dd1-9ea1-81a91be485b8" label="text-like">and Octave of the Nativity.</l><l xml:id="m-9f8acdf2-77c8-4137-90e4-7ccb420d66fc" facs="#m-722a98b6-b241-421b-968d-48e8c3c3f951" label="text-like">Double of II Class.</l><l xml:id="m-7b205d81-42d3-4590-85c0-2eecc03c3368" facs="#m-4a6ed53c-0252-4d2f-9d64-c22581a3ed65" label="text-like">AT FIRST VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-01d0b331-0552-471a-bfcc-6339f8e36f31" facs="#m-275a120d-bee1-4e3b-b7e3-ca5f9419e721" label="text-like">All as at and Vespers, p. 442, excent the following:</l><l xml:id="m-32759ae4-ac4f-4ef8-a62b-c5ea0b99be37" facs="#m-5d1a051a-9ef5-4cdf-9d95-bd54e9a3eb74" label="lyrics-like">V. Vérbum cáro fáctum est, allelúia.</l><l xml:id="m-c4d91ff2-51fb-47f3-908a-a5e115abbd0f" facs="#m-3c630f03-b0ca-4b2e-a18c-f3a81c9082d3" label="lyrics-like">K. Et habitávit in nóbis, alleluia.</l><l xml:id="m-46fbe2d7-74bf-4bfb-84a0-7533461cc80e" facs="#m-ae8738c3-fccf-4fcc-9b3a-dd66a24e8978" label="text-like">At Magn.4</l><l xml:id="m-811198bf-77b5-4ca0-a764-1c93bd204425" facs="#m-f2f8a13f-7624-482e-bde2-d2502c5d54a4" label="lyrics-like">ERo-pter ními-am“ ca-ri-tátem sú-am, qua di¬</l><l xml:id="m-4fa51e38-6cf8-44ec-9441-4e87f6e65ce7" facs="#m-f94d8fe8-cc46-41d5-ac57-879d09d16f03" label="lyrics-like">lé-xit nos Dé-us, Fi-li- um sú-um mí-sit</l><l xml:id="m-8eb64e43-54b2-4824-992c-e35c2a05c79b" facs="#m-c210a11d-857d-49b9-94aa-0632fdbc441d" label="ambiguous">in simi¬</l><l xml:id="m-6b3b3ad9-441a-40a8-9506-7af1e1eb0b06" facs="#m-6bd08eb7-0e01-42b5-9e70-ecd0ac32d93d" label="lyrics-like">li-tú-dinem cárnis peccá-ti, alle-lú-ia. E u o u a e¬</l><l xml:id="m-ad5ded1f-f218-4ca1-b1c4-6a2ff08b785c" facs="#m-8f77fec9-5093-4ecd-951c-66d35e000d77" label="lyrics-like">Cant. Magníficat. 8. G. 212, or p. 218. — Prayer. Deus, qui salútis¬</l><l xml:id="m-140e00dc-0650-434f-a868-200482002697" facs="#m-82dda271-99a2-49e1-b5a8-201781f7196b" label="ambiguous">». 441.</l><l xml:id="m-bb297888-4457-45b9-bb6f-e62fa36d3139" facs="#m-930ec676-1625-4f3d-9161-53352c612e63" label="text-like">No Commemoration is made unless a feast, which is a Double or II Class.</l><l xml:id="m-c8c6bf3a-1c0f-4198-9bdd-f4dcd8559552" facs="#m-704ec73d-f16a-4b66-84d3-0b80af7f0363" label="text-like">should fall on Dec. Srst.</l><l xml:id="m-9227ef54-83fd-47ca-911c-03b8706a8bd8" facs="#m-f8d40e87-f4f7-4ad3-ad00-6847fe3fe04c" label="lyrics-like">At Prime. Ant. O admirábile commércium. D. 442. In the Short Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-70e8c9d2-f45f-4e7d-99d8-f6e3e1eb0ab5" facs="#m-eae1c9c6-4e7f-47ca-9dcb-f49bcdeaeba7" label="lyrics-like">V. Qui nátus es. D. 229. Short Lesson. Ipsi persbunt. p. 142.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>